
Property get operations.
USAGE:

GET [<property list>] [<get switches>]
NOTE: <property list> ::= <property name> | <property name>,  <property list>

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
Blocking Requests Rejected         	N/A                 	N/A       
Bytes Received/sec                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Bytes Total/sec                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Bytes Transmitted/sec              	N/A                 	N/A       
Caption                            	N/A                 	N/A       
Context Blocks Queued/sec          	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors Access Permissions          	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors Granted Access              	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors Logon                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors System                      	N/A                 	N/A       
File Directory Searches            	N/A                 	N/A       
Files Open                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Files Opened Total                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Frequency_Object                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Frequency_PerfTime                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Frequency_Sys100NS                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Logon Total                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Logon/sec                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Nonpaged Bytes                	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Nonpaged Failures             	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Nonpaged Peak                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Paged Bytes                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Paged Failures                	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Paged Peak                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Server Sessions                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Errored Out               	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Forced Off                	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Logged Off                	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Timed Out                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Timestamp_Object                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Timestamp_PerfTime                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Timestamp_Sys100NS                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Work Item Shortages                	N/A                 	N/A       

The following GET switches are available:

/VALUE                       - Return value.
/ALL(default)                - Return the data and metadata for the attribute.
/TRANSLATE:<table name>      - Translate output via values from <table name>.
/EVERY:<interval> [/REPEAT:<repeat count>] - Returns value every (X interval) seconds, If /REPEAT specified the command is executed <repeat count> times.
/FORMAT:<format specifier>   - Keyword/XSL filename to process the XML results.

NOTE: Order of /TRANSLATE and /FORMAT switches influences the appearance of output.
Case1: If /TRANSLATE precedes /FORMAT, then translation of results will be followed by formatting.
Case2: If /TRANSLATE succeeds /FORMAT, then translation of the formatted results will be done.

